Automated Incident Alerting Service
Prerequisites
Basic Linux command line knowledge
Understanding of file permissions and text editing
Familiarity with log files
Basic Python programming concepts
Learning Objectives
By completing this lab, you will:

Understand automated security incident detection
Configure alert triggers based on security events
Format and send notifications via multiple channels
Implement a basic Security Information and Event Management (SIEM) workflow
Environment Setup
After clicking "Start Lab", you'll have access to a bare-metal Linux machine. Install the required tools:

# Update package manager
sudo apt update

# Install Python and pip
sudo apt install -y python3 python3-pip

# Install required Python libraries
pip3 install watchdog pyyaml

# Create working directory
mkdir -p ~/incident-alerting
cd ~/incident-alerting
